<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <link type="image/png" rel="icon" href="<%= botAvatar %>">
    <title>功能選擇 | <%= botName %>
    </title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&family=ZCOOL+KuaiLe&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/animejs@3.2.1/lib/anime.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #FFC8DD;
            --primary-hover: #FFAFCC;
            --dark-pink: #FF7B9C;
            --dark-color: #2B2D42;
            --text-color: #4A4E69;
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE5EC 0%, #F0E6FF 100%);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--bg-gradient);
            font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            color: var(--dark-color);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        h1,
        h2,
        h3,
        .navbar-brand {
            font-family: 'ZCOOL KuaiLe', 'Noto Sans TC', cursive, sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .navbar {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45) !important;
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .container-custom {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px 60px;
        }

        .guild-header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            padding: 50px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(255, 183, 197, 0.15);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .guild-header h1 {
            font-weight: 400;
            font-size: 2.3rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FF7B9C, #7455F7);
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .server-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 183, 197, 0.6);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--dark-pink);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
            font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
        }

        .choice-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 45px 35px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark-color);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100%;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(150, 150, 150, 0.04);
        }

        .choice-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.45rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .choice-card p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
            opacity: 0.88;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .choice-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(255, 166, 188, 0.35);
            border-color: rgba(255, 123, 156, 0.5);
        }

        .choice-card:hover h3 {
            color: var(--dark-pink);
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 4.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05));
        }

        .choice-card:hover .icon {
            transform: scale(1.2) rotate(6deg);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 15px rgba(255, 123, 156, 0.2));
        }

        .btn-back {
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            color: var(--dark-pink);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            transform: translateX(-4px);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

        <div class="guild-header text-center">
            <div class="container">
                <h1 id="headerTitle"><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders me-2"></i>功能控制中心</h1>
                <div class="server-tag" id="serverTag">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i>
                    <%= typeof guildName !=='undefined' && guildName ? guildName : '指定 Discord 伺服器' %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="container py-2 text-center" style="max-width: 1200px; flex: 1;">
            <p class="fs-5 mb-5 fw-medium" style="color: var(--text-color); opacity: 0.9;">請選擇您想要客製化配置的功能類別欄位功能喵 🐾</p>

            <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
                <!-- 1. 歡迎訊息設定 -->
                <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 choice-card-wrapper">
                    <a href="/manage/<%= guildId %>/welcome" class="choice-card">
                        <div class="icon">👋</div>
                        <h3>歡迎訊息設定</h3>
                        <p>輕鬆客製化新成員進群時的專屬招呼語、多功能 Canvas 繪製圖片與 Embed 進階豐富型內嵌卡片頻道。</p>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. 守則認證設定 -->
                <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 choice-card-wrapper">
                    <a href="/manage/<%= guildId %>/rules" class="choice-card">
                        <div class="icon">📜</div>
                        <h3>守則認證設定</h3>
                        <p>快速配置伺服器驗證守則！支援網頁端發布全新 Embed 規範或綁定既有訊息，讓成員點擊 ✅ 即可獲得指定身份組喵。</p>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. 反應身分組設定 -->
                <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 choice-card-wrapper">
                    <a href="/manage/<%= guildId %>/reaction-role" class="choice-card">
                        <div class="icon">🏷️</div>
                        <h3>反應身分組設定</h3>
                        <p>自由設定多組「表情 ⇄ 身分組」映射規則！成員在指定訊息下點擊表情，即可一鍵領取或移除特定身分組。</p>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. 工單系統設定 -->
                <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 choice-card-wrapper">
                    <a href="/manage/<%= guildId %>/ticket" class="choice-card">
                        <div class="icon">📩</div>
                        <h3>工單系統設定</h3>
                        <p>自訂銀喵專屬的公告與聯絡支援內嵌卡片文字！設計專屬的主題標題與內文，隨時一鍵配合指令發佈喵。</p>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- 5. 語音設定 -->
                <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 choice-card-wrapper">
                    <a href="/manage/<%= guildId %>/voice" class="choice-card">
                        <div class="icon">🔊</div>
                        <h3>語音設定</h3>
                        <p>配置語音主頻道！成員加入後將自動創建專屬的語音子頻道，並在房間無人時自動清除，維持伺服器整潔喵🐾</p>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- 6. Embed 多卡片廣播 -->
                <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-6 choice-card-wrapper">
                    <a href="/manage/<%= guildId %>/embed" class="choice-card">
                        <div class="icon">📢</div>
                        <h3>Embed 多卡片廣播</h3>
                        <p>打造精美的資訊公告！可同時自訂最多 10 張內容與邊框顏色的 Embed 卡片，並直接排版發送到指定的 Discord 頻道喵🐾</p>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 mb-5">
                <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-back">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> 返回伺服器列表面板
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <%- include('partials/footer') %>

            <script>
                document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
                    anime({
                        targets: '.guild-header',
                        opacity: [0, 1],
                        translateY: [-30, 0],
                        duration: 600,
                        easing: 'easeOutQuad'
                    });

                    anime({
                        targets: '.choice-card-wrapper',
                        opacity: [0, 1],
                        scale: [0.9, 1],
                        translateY: [30, 0],
                        duration: 500,
                        delay: anime.stagger(80),
                        easing: 'easeOutQuad'
                    });
                });
            </script>
</body>

</html>